AYE JAWAAN ALI AKBER AYE HASEEN ALI AKBER <br>
KHAA GAYI TUMHE BETA YEH ZAMEEN ALI AKBER<br>
<br>
1. DARD HAI KAHAN BETA BAAT TO KARO BETA <br>
 SAAMNE PIDAR KE YUN AAH NA BHARO BETA<br>
 AB SHIGAAF HOTA HAI (2) DIL HAZEEN ALI AKBER<br>
<br>
2. KYA SINA YEH KHAYI HAI KYA SITAM YEH DHAYI HAI <br>
 MAA KE AUR ZAINAB KE YEH JIGAR ME AAYI HAI<br>
 RO RAHI HAI DO MAA'EN (2) BAR ZAMEEN ALI AKBER<br>
<br>
3. HAYE TERI MADAR KO CHAIN PHIR NA AAYEGA <br>
 JOH NA HOSAKI SHADI GHAM USE RULAYEGA<br>
 MAA KI MANNATOUN WALE (2) TEH TUMHI ALI AKBER<br>
<br>
4. KHAAK HAI YEH DUNIYA PER YEH BHI KOI JEENA HAI <br>
 TUM GAYE JAWAAN HOKER YEH ZAIEF ZINDA HAI <br>
 AB MERI SHAHADAT BHI (2) HAI QAREEN ALI AKBER<br>
<br>
5. DEKHLO ALI AKBER WOH MERA MADINA HAI <br>
 TERI MUNTAZIR BETA WOH KHADI ZAIEFA HAI <br>
 WOH BAHEN TERI SUGHRA (2) NAZNEEN ALI AKBER<br>
<br>
6. YA KHUDA KISI KI BHI AAAS NA KABHI TOOTEY <br>
 JIS TARHA SE SUGHRA KE BHAI HAI SABHI ROOTHEY <br>
 MUJH LO LENE AAYEINGE (2) HAI YAQEEN ALI AKBER<br>
<br>
7. GHAM ME SHEH KE AYE DAWAR MOUT HAM KO PYARI HAI <br>
 MATAM E ALI AKBER ZINDAGI HAMARI HAI<br>
 HAR JAWAAN KE SEENE ME (2) HAI YAQEEN ALI AKBER<br>
<br>
 AZZ...DAWAR ALI DAWAR.